### Create PROJECT-level OWNER access
POST http://localhost:8084/api/access-grants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "principalId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "principalType": "USER",
  "projectId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "environment": null,
  "scopeType": "PROJECT",
  "role": "OWNER",
  "effect": "ALLOW",
  "validFrom": null,
  "validUntil": null,
  "createdBy": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222"
}


### Create ENVIRONMENT-level VIEWER access for prod
POST http://localhost:8084/api/access-grants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "principalId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "principalType": "USER",
  "projectId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "environment": "prod",
  "scopeType": "ENVIRONMENT",
  "role": "VIEWER",
  "effect": "ALLOW",
  "validFrom": null,
  "validUntil": null,
  "createdBy": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222"
}


