### List project grants
GET http://localhost:8084/api/access-grants/projects/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111


### OWNER can read prod secret
POST http://localhost:8084/internal/access-checks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "principalId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "principalType": "USER",
  "projectId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "environment": "prod",
  "action": "SECRET_READ"
}


### VIEWER can read prod secret
POST http://localhost:8084/internal/access-checks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "principalId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "principalType": "USER",
  "projectId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "environment": "prod",
  "action": "SECRET_READ"
}


### VIEWER cannot delete prod secret
POST http://localhost:8084/internal/access-checks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "principalId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "principalType": "USER",
  "projectId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "environment": "prod",
  "action": "SECRET_DELETE"
}


### DEVELOPER can update dev secret
POST http://localhost:8084/internal/access-checks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "principalId": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444",
  "principalType": "USER",
  "projectId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "environment": "dev",
  "action": "SECRET_UPDATE"
}